U7DWbs8AAAAC-WvPDw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dwroy/agent-sts2/labels/type:research","name":"type:research","color":"7057ff","default":false,"description":"analysis or experiment, no production change","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":12774526905,"node_id":"LA_kwDOU7DWbs8AAAAC-WvPuQ","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dwroy/agent-sts2/labels/status:ready","name":"status:ready","color":"0e8a16","default":false,"description":"can start now","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":2,"created_at":"2026-10-21T07:07:27Z","updated_at":"2026-10-22T00:56:02Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"OWNER","active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"## 目标\n\n学习者编写大脑的文字策略库（`docs/v6-plan.md` 第 13 节步骤 3）：“情境 → 策略”条目，每条带触发条件、策略文字、证据、来源（`own` / `external:<名>`）和可信度。格式和检索由 #16 提供。\n\n## 来源\n\n1. 外部数据：#24 的真人拿牌、流派与战斗统计，#25 的知识库；\n2. 大脑自己的历史决策与之后的结果（#16 的数据集）：哪些习惯稳定、哪些选择之后结果明显更差；\n3. 复盘与已有经验库。\n\n## 要求\n\n- 按学习协议（第 3、9 节）：每条带证据（局号，或外部来源、版本、样本与 SHA），观察结果标 `design=observational`，冲突与反例保留。\n- 先覆盖死得最多的地方：第一幕 Boss（同族、墨影幻灵等）、第二幕 Boss，以及拿牌与幕初方向。\n- 条目数量适度、可检索，不把整库堆进提示。\n\n## 验收\n\n- [ ] 首批条目及其证据，经学习者自测后按原流程上线\n- [ ] 上线后首局核对：大脑题面实际读到了相关条目\n\n## 负责人与边界\n\nowner:learner，经 ops 按学习协议派发；#16 与 #24 已完成交付，沿原 ops 学习派发链待派（status:ready；未启动不算已派）。学习者任务模板中“只能依据本系统对局证据”的表述，按协议第 9 节更新。\n","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dwroy/agent-sts2/issues/27/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dwroy/agent-sts2/issues/27/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null}
